        "TileImage": "$($repository ad9f7ad0-ff67-44b0-ad51-5d969a23b03d).Image",
        "Description": "Using our access to Judgement Day&apos;s encrypted messages, thanks to the data extracted from Dartmoor, the keyword &apos;Paris&apos; has appeared countless times. Information taken from Hokkaido also shows that there will be a bidding contest at the Palais de Walewska attended by the group&apos;s leaders, and the contest will be rigged, Judgement Day purchasing WMDs and state secrets. Your mission is to kill the &apos;Five Judges&apos; of Judgement Day, bringing the organisation to its knees and saving millions of lives.",
